<title>USA: Reliant Buildings Products sells $70 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Reliant Buildings Products sells $70 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement from Reliant Building Products Inc was priced on Monday via lead manager Chase Securities Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>BORROWER RELIANT BUILDING PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $70 MLN	  COUPON 10 7/8 PCT MATURITY 5/1/04</p>
