<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD NA	   CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FOUR-YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT OF THE ISSUE AT</p>
<p>110.875.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1662))</p>
